; THE FAIRY'S WINGS (cc_task_m2 Part 4): two of DevMops's Angel Wing (OpenGameArt, CC0), the left one mirrored,
; swept back 35 degrees and set behind the chest of a KayKit hero body, on its chest bone (HeroMinis, HeldItems).
; The FBX names no texture, so each wing wears the pack's base colour map here, which the painted shader reads.
; A first pass from the numbers, for Kathleen to place by eye: size, spread, height and sweep are the two
; transforms below (a KayKit body is about 2.2 units tall before the mini scales it).

